; End-to-end fixture for `--json-schema-dep` (feature request 12). Driven by
; `integration_tests::json_schema_dep_threading`, which generates this spec with
; `--json-schema-dep=dep_crate=crate::vendored_dep`, appends a `vendored_dep` module to the
; seed-once `wasm/json-gen/src/lib.rs`, runs the json-gen crate, and asserts the vendored module's
; UNREFERENCED root reached the document's `$defs` alongside this spec's own type.
;
; Deliberately minimal: one own type, which is all the cell needs on this side. The whole subject of
; the cell lives on the OTHER side — a root nothing in this spec points at, so no closure over this
; document could reach it, which is exactly the 60-definition gap the flag exists to close.
own_thing = [a: uint, b: text]
